            <ArticleTitle>Direct repair of giant right coronary aneurysm.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1401-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a novel method for surgical repair of giant right coronary aneurysm. Instead of aneurysm ligation and coronary bypass we mobilized the inflow and outflow and performed end-to-end anastomosis. This preserved the native vessel. Restudy in both patients confirmed the effectiveness of this technique.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
